WEBVTT

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.090
He combined with his D-Wheel.

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:20.860
Witness the D-Wheel's final form!

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:29.670
The city!

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:34.570
Stop it!

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:47.450
What's your goal?  Why are you 
putting the city in chaos?

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:54.190
If you're opposing me, that means you're 
opposing Iliaster and god's will!

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:55.950
Illiaster?

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:59.230
You're the ones who messed with Godwin

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:02.940
and the Dark Signers' destinies 
to put the world in danger!

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:08.170
You don't know even though you 
were given a stone tablet?

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:09.440
What?

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:15.470
It seems god only chose you on a whim.

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:18.190
I'm free to crush you.

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:21.450
I won't let you do whatever you want!

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:23.660
I promise to stop you!

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:27.100
How dare you cut into this duel!

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.630
Meklord Emperor will punish you!

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:35.310
Meklord Emperor has the fearsome 
power to absorb Synchro Monsters.

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:46.740
But I found a new power within speed!

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:50.100
I'll believe in my power and battle!

00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:53.950
Yusei!

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.160
Leave the Ghosts to me!

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:57.740
I'm counting on you!

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.090
Duel!

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:15.110
My turn!

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:19.270
I send Quillbolt Hedgehog 
in my hand to the graveyard!

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:24.610
I can Special Summon Quickdraw Synchron when 
I send a monster in my hand to the graveyard!

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:32.810
Since there's a Tuner on my 
field, I can Special Summon

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:35.710
the Quillbolt Hedgehog that 
I sent to my graveyard!

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:43.390
Then I summon Needle Soldier!

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:55.060
Level 5 Quickdraw Synchron tunes Level 1 
Needle Soldier and Level 2 Quillbolt Hedgehog!

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:07.640
Fighting vigor comes together to 
call forth the roaring spirit!

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:09.320
Become the path that lights the way!

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:11.560
Synchro Summon!

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.870
Pulverize, Junk Destroyer!

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:21.770
You're still using a 
Synchro Summon against me?

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:24.290
You're just like a bug that never evolves!

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.290
Riding Duels.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.370
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:40.230
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:55.350 --> 00:04:01.520
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:11.630
Soar in the infinite skies   BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:17.870
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:23.810
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:29.580
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:35.190
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:41.560
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:47.370
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:53.670
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:59.980
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:29.840
Fear Resurrects  Meklord Emperor Wisel

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:33.600
I activate Junk Destroyer's effect!

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:37.180
When it's Synchro Summoned, 
I destroy cards equal

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:41.050
to the number of non-Tuner 
Synchro Material Monsters!

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:43.320
I can destroy two cards!

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:47.780
I destroy Meklord Emperor 
Wisel's body and that set card!

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:52.020
Tidal Energy!

00:05:55.840 --> 00:06:00.040
As long as he has Meklord Emperor, 
he'll take my Synchro Monsters.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:05.390
But I'll have nothing to fear 
if I destroy it before his turn.

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:08.780
I activate my trap Divergence.

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:14.250
When my Machine-Type monster is 
attacked or takes a card effect...

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:17.620
I can switch the target to a 
different Machine-Type monster.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:20.350
I switch the target to Wisel Carrier!

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:21.350
What?

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:26.920
Wisel Carrier can't be 
destroyed by card effects!

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:35.330
A Synchro Monster's effect is 
nothing more than a mosquito bite!

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:38.770
But Junk Destroyer has greater attack points!

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:43.100
Battle!  Junk Destroyer attacks Wisel!

00:06:44.010 --> 00:06:45.600
Destroy Knuckle!

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:48.590
You fool!

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:54.810
Did you forget that due to its effect, the 
attack target switches to Wisel Guard?

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:00.470
When a Synchro Monster uses Needle Soldier

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:03.530
as Synchro Material and attacks 
a monster in defense position...

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:05.260
...it deals piercing damage!

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:06.070
What?

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:11.110
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:16.370
Why?

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:20.750
Why does Yusei Fudo get a stone tablet?

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:26.610
That item was entrusted to us so that we 
can guide history in the proper direction!

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:30.220
So why does that human get one?

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:32.730
Be quiet and watch.

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:37.940
Only god knows the outcome of this duel.

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:42.310
How dare you do that!  You're just a bug!

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:48.710
I don't know what god wants you to do.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.910
But I won't accept it!

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:55.120
Not just you, but everyone in the world!

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:16.880
What?

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:20.880
What's happening?

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:29.020
What's this?

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:39.180
A power outage?

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:40.950
What's going on?

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:46.370
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:51.010
Miss, pull yourself together!  Miss!

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:57.920
You regained consciousness.

00:08:57.920 --> 00:08:58.980
Mizoguchi.

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:07.890
What's going on in this city?

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:19.280
We have problems with Ghost, 
and now there's a power outage?

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:21.840
What's going to happen to the city?

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:25.310
You can't contact headquarters?

00:09:25.310 --> 00:09:29.550
The electronics are jammed for some reason-

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:43.200
Even digital cameras?  What's going on?

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.410
Where am I?

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:59.150
I remember that before...

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:03.140
I don't know why, but my wheels locked.

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:08.020
My powers didn't activate?

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:15.760
I no longer have those powers?

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:24.430
What's this?

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:34.660
That's...

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:40.170
My turn!

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:44.020
I summon Wisel Guard 3 in defense position.

00:10:55.930 --> 00:11:00.970
Once per turn, Meklord Emperor Wisel 
absorbs one of your Synchro Monsters.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:05.710
Your measly Synchro Monster 
becomes food for Meklord Emperor!

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.410
I activate the trap Star Shift!

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:26.510
I return a Synchro Monster on 
my field back to my deck...

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:29.700
...to Special Summon another Synchro 
Monster with the same Level!

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:30.570
What?

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:36.110
Appear, Stardust Dragon!

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:42.310
You avoided it.

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:46.480
Meklord Emperor Wisel and Stardust Dragon 
have the same number of attack points.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:50.650
I set one card and end my turn.

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:56.260
Since you used an anti-Meklord Emperor 
card, it means that even bugs can learn.

00:11:56.260 --> 00:11:59.900
But you won't find escape routes forever!

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:01.510
Watch!

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:06.170
Due to the bond with my cards and my 
new power, I promise to defeat you!

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:32.560
Yusei is fighting over there.

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:42.410
It's fine.  You don't need to be scared.

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:46.310
Do you duel?

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:50.070
I'm Haruka.

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:54.290
Let's duel!  I'm strong!

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:02.560
My turn!

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:07.040
I summon Bicular in defense position!

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:14.910
I activate the trap Emerging Awakening.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:19.690
When I summon a monster, I remove 
another monster from play...

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:22.910
...to deal damage equal to its 
Level multiplied by 100 points!

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:26.000
I remove Stardust Dragon from play!

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:38.180
The removed monster returns to the field 
on the Standby Phase of my next turn...

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:42.490
...and it gains attack points equal 
to its Level multiplied by 100 points!

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:45.240
I set one card and end my turn!

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:49.060
I'm almost ready to Accel Synchro.

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:51.190
I won't let him do whatever he likes!

00:13:58.260 --> 00:14:02.650
I hate humans driving in front of me!

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:04.510
My turn!

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:08.000
I activate the trap Explosive Blast.

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:14.020
I destroy a Machine-Type monster on my 
field that hasn't battled this turn...

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:17.080
...and you take damage equal to its 
Level multiplied by 400 points.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.460
I destroy Wisel Carrier!

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:20.030
What?

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:28.890
I'll destroy everyone who gets 
in front of Meklord Emperor!

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:31.490
I summon Skiel Carrier 3!

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:33.680
Skiel?

00:14:45.470 --> 00:14:49.930
Skiel is a Meklord Emperor part that 
Lua and Luca battled previously!

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:57.520
When did he get that?

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:03.780
How dare Placido use my card!

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:09.250
Then I can Special Summon this 
card by releasing Skiel Carrier 3.

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:10.220
What?

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:13.160
Appear, Skiel Carrier 5!

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:15.950
Show Meklord Emperor's 
infinite power to the world!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:38.600
Skiel and Wisel.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.500
Two different Meklord Emperor types combined.

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:46.240
Does Meklord Emperor continue to 
power up by changing its form?

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:56.730
Tech Genus Power Gladiator 
attacks you directly!

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.170
Machinize Slash!

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:06.350
All the minions are gone.

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:13.540
What was that impact?

00:16:14.230 --> 00:16:16.950
It's as if the earth itself is scared.

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:25.380
Meklord Emperor Wisel attacks Bicular!

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:34.440
Due to Skiel Carrier 5's effect, 
you take 300 points of damage

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:36.770
when it destroys a monster in battle!

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:47.680
Since Bicular was destroyed, I can Special 
Summon Unicycular from my deck in defense position!

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:57.030
I set one card and end my turn.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:05.260
No matter how hard you try, you 
can't get ahead of the chosen one.

00:17:05.610 --> 00:17:08.410
I must do an Accel Synchro now!

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:13.300
My turn!

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:17.720
Due to Emerging Awakening, 
Stardust Dragon returns

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:21.180
during the Standby Phase 
with more attack points!

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:32.220
Will Yusei finally do it?

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:37.200
I'll show you Accel Synchro Summon, 
the Synchro that surpasses Synchro!

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.760
Synchro that surpasses Synchro?  Whatever!

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:41.870
You can't surpass anything.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:46.730
You just obey your destiny and 
keep repeating foolish history!

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:47.950
What are you trying to say?

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:50.570
I summon Turbo Synchron!

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:59.780
Level 1 Turbo Synchron 
tunes Level 1 Unicycular!

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:05.400
The wishes come together to 
invite a new world of speed!

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:07.250
Become the path that lights the way!

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:08.900
Synchro Summon!

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:13.570
The power of hope!  Synchro 
Tuner Formula Synchron!

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:19.870
With Formula Synchron's effect, I can 
draw a card from my deck once per turn!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:44.440
Get under the roof!

00:18:55.570 --> 00:19:00.940
Don't worry.  My friends are 
fighting to protect this city.

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.030
Yusei...

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:12.500
Your Synchro Summon symbolizes 
humanity's foolish evolution.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:15.360
But what did humanity's evolution 
ultimately accomplish?

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:17.890
Did you forget the tragedy of Zero Reverse?

00:19:25.590 --> 00:19:32.820
Level 2 Synchro Tuner Formula Synchron tunes 
Level 8 Synchro Monster Stardust Dragon!

00:19:36.350 --> 00:19:40.360
Dreams crystallize to open 
a new door of evolution!

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:42.400
Become the path that lights the way!

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:51.010
With your cursed destiny, you're repeating 
the same mistakes that your father made!

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:55.480
Accel Synchro!

00:19:58.630 --> 00:19:59.540
What?

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:03.010
Accel Synchro misfired and ended.

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:08.760
I was wondering what you were going 
to show me, but it was a total farce!

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:13.240
Why did Accel Synchro fail?

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:16.960
Were you planning to use 
the stone tablet card?

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:19.950
It means you never had the power to do that.

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:24.210
Perish along with this world, Yusei Fudo!

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:34.940
Stop it!

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:39.250
Battle!  Stardust Dragon 
attacks Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:41.560
Shooting Sonic!

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:50.600
Due to Skiel Carrier 5's effect, attacking 
my monster is negated once per turn!

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:51.420
What?

00:20:56.710 --> 00:20:57.990
I end my turn.

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:00.230
My turn!

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:03.070
Due to Meklord Emperor Wisel's effect,

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:08.520
it absorbs a Synchro Monster 
on your field once per turn!

00:21:09.050 --> 00:21:11.410
I'm taking your Stardust Dragon!

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:37.980
You'll never defeat Meklord Emperor 
in hundreds of millions of years!

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:41.070
You'll learn the power 
of the true chosen one!

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:56.260
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:21:56.730 --> 00:22:02.930
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:21.220
You always pretend and hide your fears

00:22:21.550 --> 00:22:26.860
You act tough and don't listen to anyone

00:22:27.160 --> 00:22:32.460
You do this over and over

00:22:32.800 --> 00:22:38.170
I shouted until my soul would break

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:43.570
Hurry up and throw that away

00:22:44.110 --> 00:22:51.080
We're only heading towards tomorrow

00:22:51.520 --> 00:22:56.820
Close to you   If you're 
trying to find yourself

00:22:57.220 --> 00:23:02.660
Just keep doing what you ultimately decided

00:23:02.790 --> 00:23:08.100
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:23:08.600 --> 00:23:16.210
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you
